WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.936
Watch and read: Ama asks: What would you say to someone celebrating a birthday?

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:10.157
The answer is: Happy birthday!. Choose a warm greeting that matches the occasion.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.852
Watch and read: Ama asks: Yesterday at home, Ama cooked dinner. Which sentence

00:00:15.852 --> 00:00:16.964
reports the event?

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:22.093
The answer is: Ama cooked dinner.. Retell home events using what happened.
